      "text": "PANOORIN: Narito ang highlights ng ALERT QC (Awareness, Lifesaving, Emergency Response Training) na isinagawa ng Quezon City Government para matiyak na handa at ligtas sa anumang sakuna ang bawat negosyo sa lungsod.\n\nAng ALERT QC ay isang 3-day training na pinangunahan ng QC Business Permits and Licensing Department (QC BPLD) at QC Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Office (QCDRRMO) para sanayin ang ang mga negosyante, safety officers, at staff responders ukol sa earthquake preparedness, fire safety, emergency response, at first aid.",
